{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>עלה</b> — Now return to speak of Nineveh." "<b>והמפיץ</b> — He is Nebuchadnezzar." "<b>נצור מצורה</b> — He speaks to the king of Nineveh. <b>וככה צפה דרך</b> — Station watchmen on the roads. And the Gaon [Saadia] said: נצור is a verb, like ויכלת עמוד, and thus <b>וככה צפה דרך</b> — to block the breaches. And know."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {2 "Resolved הנגיד as 'the Gaon [Saadia]' by inference from Ibn Ezra's standard usage. The reading לכלא הפשע ('to block the breaches') translated hyper-literally; the syntax of וככה צפה דרך here is elliptical and potentially obscure."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:33.161384423Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}